then the more deep the roots go.

696
00:52:21.000 --> 00:52:25.000
And so we have to keep doing this reparation all the time.

697
00:52:25.000 --> 00:52:28.000
Why? Because sin is happening all the time,

698
00:52:28.000 --> 00:52:31.000
because the church is being brought down all the time,

699
00:52:31.000 --> 00:52:33.000
because the Lord is being offended all the time.

700
00:52:33.000 --> 00:52:36.000
That's why we've got to continue.

701
00:52:36.000 --> 00:52:39.000
And that's our way of saying, I love you.

702
00:52:39.000 --> 00:52:41.000
Okay.

703
00:52:41.000 --> 00:52:45.000
I, myself, will administer to you the thoughts, the affections, the words,

704
00:52:45.000 --> 00:52:48.000
so that you may remain around me.

705
00:52:48.000 --> 00:52:50.000
Be faithful to me.

706
00:52:50.000 --> 00:52:52.000
Times are short.

707
00:52:52.000 --> 00:52:57.000
Justice wants to unfold its fury and humanity irritates divine justice.

708
00:52:57.000 --> 00:53:01.000
It is necessary that these props multiply more.

709
00:53:01.000 --> 00:53:06.000
That means that more people get involved and do not fail in the work.

710
00:53:06.000 --> 00:53:07.000
Okay.

711
00:53:07.000 --> 00:53:10.000
I'll give you another one.

712
00:53:10.000 --> 00:53:15.000
This is August the 24th, 1915.

713
00:53:15.000 --> 00:53:22.000
The only thing that makes the soul like God is the divine will.

714
00:53:22.000 --> 00:53:25.000
The only thing.

715
00:53:25.000 --> 00:53:28.000
Is that interesting?

716
00:53:28.000 --> 00:53:33.000
So this is a very important message again, and we'll finish with this one.

717
00:53:33.000 --> 00:53:38.000
Continuing in my usual state, my beloved Jesus came for just a little,

718
00:53:38.000 --> 00:53:43.000
and I gave him a kiss telling him, my Jesus, if it were possible,

719
00:53:43.000 --> 00:53:48.000
I would like to give you the kiss of all souls.

720
00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:54.000
In this way, I will satisfy your love by bringing them all to you.

721
00:53:54.000 --> 00:53:56.000
He's going to tell her how to do it, isn't he?

722
00:53:56.000 --> 00:54:00.000
He said, my daughter, if you want to give me the kiss of all,

723
00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.000
kiss me in my will.

724
00:54:03.000 --> 00:54:06.000
I love you with your will.

725
00:54:06.000 --> 00:54:08.000
Okay, I kiss you with your will.

726
00:54:08.000 --> 00:54:12.000
I honor you with your will.

727
00:54:12.000 --> 00:54:18.000
Kiss me with my will because my will, containing the creative power,

728
00:54:18.000 --> 00:54:24.000
contains the power to multiply one act into as many acts as one wants.

729
00:54:24.000 --> 00:54:28.000
So if you want to do that all the time, I say to him,

730
00:54:28.000 --> 00:54:33.000
I want to multiply this act to infinity for an infinitude of time,

731
00:54:33.000 --> 00:54:38.000
covers all time, all eternity.

732
00:54:38.000 --> 00:54:43.000
So the divine will multiply the act as much as you want.

733
00:54:43.000 --> 00:54:49.000
In this way, you will give me the contentment as if all were kissing me

734
00:54:49.000 --> 00:54:55.000
and you will have the merit as if you had made everyone do it.

735
00:54:55.000 --> 00:54:59.000
So the merits coming to you are absolutely enormous.

736
00:54:59.000 --> 00:55:05.000
While all souls will receive the effects according to their dispositions,

737
00:55:05.000 --> 00:55:09.000
now note according to their dispositions, some will receive a lot,

738
00:55:09.000 --> 00:55:12.000
some will receive little, some will receive nothing.

739
00:55:12.000 --> 00:55:16.000
Now the ones who receive nothing at all go back to you,

740
00:55:16.000 --> 00:55:21.000
because in the divine economy nothing is lost.

741
00:55:21.000 --> 00:55:29.000
So Jesus said, "One act in my will contains all possible imaginable goods."

742
00:55:29.000 --> 00:55:33.000
It's difficult for us to take that on board, isn't it?

743
00:55:33.000 --> 00:55:39.000
You will find an image of this in the light of the sun.

744
00:55:39.000 --> 00:55:43.000
The light is only one thing.

745
00:55:43.000 --> 00:55:47.000
But this light multiplies in all the gazes of creatures.

746
00:55:47.000 --> 00:55:51.000
The light is always one, one single act.

747
00:55:51.000 --> 00:55:55.000
But not all the gazes of people enjoy the same light.

748
00:55:55.000 --> 00:55:59.000
Some don't look at the sun at all, some hide from it.

749
00:55:59.000 --> 00:56:03.000
Some of weak sight need to put their hands before their eyes,

750
00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:07.000
almost not to feel themselves being blinded by the light.

751
00:56:07.000 --> 00:56:10.000
Others who are blind do not enjoy it at all.

752
00:56:10.000 --> 00:56:14.000
But this is not because of any defect of the light,

753
00:56:14.000 --> 00:56:18.000
because of a defect in the eyesight of the person.

754
00:56:18.000 --> 00:56:22.000
So my daughter, if you desire to love me for all,

755
00:56:22.000 --> 00:56:26.000
I love you with your will on behalf of all, that's what you say.

756
00:56:26.000 --> 00:56:31.000
If you desire to love me for all, if you do it in my will,

757
00:56:31.000 --> 00:56:36.000
your love will flow in the divine will.

758
00:56:36.000 --> 00:56:39.000
And since my will fills heaven and earth,

759
00:56:39.000 --> 00:56:44.000
I will hear your, I love you, being repeated in heaven.

760
00:56:44.000 --> 00:56:46.000
Isn't that fantastic?

761
00:56:46.000 --> 00:56:50.000
I will hear it repeated around me.

762
00:56:50.000 --> 00:56:54.000
I will hear it repeated inside of me.

763
00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:57.000
I will hear it repeated on the earth,

764
00:56:57.000 --> 00:57:00.000
and it will multiply from point to point,

765
00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:04.000
for as many acts as my divine will can do.

766
00:57:04.000 --> 00:57:07.000
Look at the enormity of that.

767
00:57:07.000 --> 00:57:12.000
Therefore, it can give me the satisfaction of the love of all,

768
00:57:12.000 --> 00:57:17.000
because the person is, we human creatures are limited and finite,

769
00:57:17.000 --> 00:57:24.000
while my will is immense and infinite.

770
00:57:24.000 --> 00:57:27.000
How can those words spoken by me in creating man,

771
00:57:27.000 --> 00:57:31.000
let us make man in our own image and likeness be explained?

772
00:57:31.000 --> 00:57:38.000
Now, that's Genesis 1.27.

773
00:57:38.000 --> 00:57:45.000
How could the creature so incapable ever resemble me and be my image?

774
00:57:45.000 --> 00:57:48.000
Only in my will can he arrive at this,

775
00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:52.000
because by making my will his own,

776
00:57:52.000 --> 00:57:57.000
he comes to operate in a divine manner.

777
00:57:57.000 --> 00:58:03.000
And through the repetition of these divine acts,

778
00:58:03.000 --> 00:58:09.000
he comes to resemble me and to become my perfect image.

779
00:58:09.000 --> 00:58:12.000
That's Romans 8.29, my perfect image.

780
00:58:12.000 --> 00:58:17.000
It's like a child who by repeating the acts which he observes

781
00:58:17.000 --> 00:58:21.000
in the teacher becomes like him.

782
00:58:21.000 --> 00:58:25.000
Now, that's 2 Corinthians 3.18.

783
00:58:25.000 --> 00:58:31.000
2 Corinthians 3.18, you become like what you worship.

784
00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:38.000
So, the only thing that makes the creature be like me is my will.

785
00:58:38.000 --> 00:58:42.000
This is why I have so much interest in that soul,

786
00:58:42.000 --> 00:58:45.000
that the soul, by making the divine will his own,

787
00:58:45.000 --> 00:58:52.000
fulfill the purpose for which he was created.

788
00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:55.000
It's not there for tonight.
